    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 Project Summary & Business Value (ROI)\n\nThis project provides a complete, production-grade inbound sales automation system for web form processing. The workflow ingests incoming leads, deduplicates records against Airtable CRM, enriches and normalizes payload data using OpenAI LLMs, and dynamically routes qualified leads.\n\n* **CRM Deduplication:** Automatic email lookup prevents multiple record creations for returning prospects.\n* **AI Normalization & Scoring:** Standardizes messy form inputs (letter capitalization, phone formatting) and evaluates purchasing intent based on budget and project scope.\n* **Sales Efficiency (ROI):** Reduces manual lead qualification and entry time by **~90%**, allowing SDRs to focus exclusively on High-Quality prospects.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 688
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1536,
        -864
      ],
