      "id": "2ed93790-4438-41bd-8e29-44756f2d8919",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 4: Deduplication Logic (IF Node)\n* **Condition:** Checks if Airtable search returned an existing record.\n* **TRUE Branch (Existing Lead):** Updates existing Airtable record (appends new inquiry details, updates last touchpoint timestamp, escalates lead status). Workflow safely completes.\n* **FALSE Branch (New Lead):** Passes lead data down to the AI qualification pipeline.\n\n",
        "height": 176,
        "width": 624,
        "color": "#127337"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2464,
        -240
      ],
      "id": "61bc9e04-1939-4ccd-bd03-5ac813704756",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 5: AI Normalization & Scoring (OpenAI)\n* **Function:** Employs LLM (`gpt-4o-mini`) for qualitative evaluation and payload structuring.\n* **Scope:** Sanitizes company/contact names, classifies industry and company size, evaluates sales potential (`score` 1–10 or `is_qualified`), extracts key requirements, and generates a 1-sentence summary.\n\n",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 384,
        "color": "#FAFAFA"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1872,
        432
      ],
      "id": "039cf944-d97f-4eea-8783-9321a2fc1200",
      "name": "Sticky Note5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 6: Parsing AI Output (JavaScript Code Node)\n* **Function:** Safely parses the structured JSON payload returned by OpenAI.\n* **Logic:** Extracts clean fields and casts data types (e.g., converts text ratings to numeric values) for CRM storage and conditional routing.\n\n",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 384,
        "color": "#CD9418"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1392,
        432
      ],
      "id": "fe96350a-6908-40af-b0db-e2f826e4dc94",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 7: Routing & CRM Insertion (IF Node)\n* **Condition:** Evaluates AI-generated lead score (e.g., `score >= 7` or `is_qualified == true`).\n* **TRUE Branch (High-Quality Lead):** Creates a record under High Priority / Hot Leads in Airtable. Optionally triggers immediate notification to the sales team.\n* **FALSE Branch (Low-Quality Lead):** Records lead under Low Priority / Nurturing / Unqualified in Airtable, preventing sales team distraction.",
        "height": 176,
        "width": 704,
        "color": "#338E94"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -768,
        512
      ],
      "id": "2e83f78b-df6e-4ad2-ab34-2b92b0eac621",
      "name": "Sticky Note7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🛡️ Reliability & Error Handling\n\n* **Retry Policy (Retry on Fail):** Nodes communicating with external APIs (Airtable, OpenAI) utilize automatic retries (3 attempts, 5-second delay) to absorb transient network glitches and rate limits.\n* **Defensive JS Parsing:** The AI Output Parser guards against schema drift with default fallbacks for incomplete LLM responses.\n* **Global Error Handler:** Connected to an overarching Error Trigger Workflow that dispatches technical Slack alerts with direct execution logs upon unhandled failure.",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 3
      },
